<title>SINGAPORE: Acer Computer 1996 net profit up 4.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Acer Computer 1996 net profit up 4.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     32.48  vs    31.03</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	  19.62  vs    22.76</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		  8.00  vs     5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover (bln)		  1.14  vs     0.87</p>
<p>    Other income		    5.32  vs     3.96</p>
<p>    Interest expense		7.07  vs     4.46</p>
<p>    Operating pretax	     28.55  vs    27.55</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (1.19) vs    (0.12)</p>
<p>    Associates		     10.98  vs     8.66</p>
<p>    Tax				 5.86  vs     5.06</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		19.09* vs     0.59</p>
<p>* The extraordinary gains came mainly from premiums from an initial public offer of Acer Computer Latino America.</p>
<p>- Note - Acer Computer International Ltd is a unit of Taiwan's Acer Inc and is responsible for sales to Asia-Pacific, African, Middle-East and Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS) markets.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
